            <staticText><reportElement positionType="Float" x="285" y="247" width="250" height="50" uuid="f70d0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"/><box leftPadding="2" rightPadding="2" topPadding="3" bottomPadding="3"><leftPen lineWidth="0.5"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.5"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.5"/></box><textElement><font fontName="SansSerif" size="8"/></textElement><text><![CDATA[If the loan is prepaid within 3 months, foreclosure charges of 3% of the outstanding loan amount plus applicable taxes will apply.
If the loan is prepaid between 3 to 4 months, foreclosure charges of 2% of the outstanding loan amount plus applicable taxes will apply.
If the loan is prepaid after 4 months, no foreclosure charges will apply.]]></text></staticText>

